1
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:10,280
Westhaven have shifted their attack
decisively to the right.

2
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:14,680
Right-side attacks have increased
from 31% to 90%.

3
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:18,280
MatchShift doesn't just tell you what changed.

4
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:20,380
WHY shows the measurements, thresholds

5
00:00:20,380 --> 00:00:22,300
and confidence behind the insight.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,900
Show me takes you to the underlying match events,

7
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:30,280
separating supporting evidence from context.

8
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:37,850
Delacroix-Bah, number 6, passes left
to Pollard, number 5,

9
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:40,830
in the centre of the penalty area.

10
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:45,830
Marchetti, number 10, passes across
to Arkwright, number 7,

11
00:00:45,830 --> 00:00:48,710
on the right of the attacking third.

12
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:53,300
[crowd cheers]

13
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:58,980
The match facts come from
deterministic analytics.

14
00:00:58,980 --> 00:01:02,280
Specialized agents interpret, adapt
and verify those grounded facts

15
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:05,100
