and support for six languages.

18
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:20,900
[French narration]
Westhaven now attack down the right.

19
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:25,780
90% of Westhaven's attacks from 50' to 62'
came down the right,

20
00:01:25,780 --> 00:01:29,930
